}}''[[General:The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim Announcement Trailer|The Elder Scrolls V: Skyrim Announcement Trailer]]'' is a short [[General:Trailers|video]] created to reveal the [[Skyrim:Skyrim|fifth main game]] in [[General:The Elder Scrolls|the series]]. The trailer primarily features a depiction of [[SR:Alduin's Wall|Alduin's Wall]], with the [[Skyrim:Music|main theme]] of ''Skyrim'' playing throughout the trailer.

[[Skyrim:Esbern|Esbern]] narrates the following:

:''"You should have acted. [[SR:Dragons|They're]] already [[SR:Skyrim (place)|here]]. The [[SR:Elder Scroll|Elder Scrolls]] told of [[Lore:Prophecy of the Dragonborn|their return]]."''
:''"Their [[Lore:Dragon War|defeat]] was merely a delay ... to the time after [[Lore:Oblivion Crisis|Oblivion opened]] ... when the [[SR:Stormcloaks|Sons of Skyrim]] would [[SR:Civil War|spill their own blood]]."''
:''"But no one wanted to believe — believe they even existed."''
:''"And when the truth finally dawns, it dawns in [[SR:Thu'um|fire]]."''
:''"But ... there's one they fear."''
:''"In [[Lore:Dragon Language|their tongue]], he is "[[Lore:Dovahkiin|Dovahkiin]]." [[Lore:Dragonborn|Dragonborn]]!"''

